00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:00.160
Trump certainly gets no credit for that.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.710
Now, what did Trump do?

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:05.620
Well, operation warp speed, operation warp
speed.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:14.329
What Trump did is what any any any president
short of a true sort of genocidal psychopath

00:01:14.329 --> 00:01:20.189
