00:01:29.649 --> 00:01:34.829
And then, yes, the government agreed to pre
purchase a whole bunch of vaccines so that

00:01:34.829 --> 00:01:39.749
production could start even before we knew
which candidate vaccine is going to eventually

00:01:39.749 --> 00:01:41.249
be the one that's used.

00:01:41.249 --> 00:01:43.990
You can give Trump credit for that if you
want.

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:47.320
Any sane president would do that.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:52.429
OK, so when we give him credit for that, what
we're saying is Trump didn't go out of his

00:01:52.429 --> 00:01:57.170
way to make it more difficult to get these
vaccines produced.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:01.039
And the reason you have to do this and the
reason this is so commonly done when you are

00:02:01.039 --> 00:02:07.060
developing a medication for an urgent health
situation is if you wait until approval to

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.799
start manufacturing, you're behind.

00:02:09.799 --> 00:02:16.909
So on spec, as we call it, you start manufacturing
vaccines before they are actually approved

00:02:16.909 --> 00:02:20.040
so that if they're approved, you have a whole
bunch of them ready to go.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.680
Trump allowed that to happen.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:23.010
He didn't get in the way of that.

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:24.010
He can get credit for that.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.010
He acted like a normal person on that.

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:27.010
On distribution.

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:29.470
He gets essentially no credit distribution
was a disaster.

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:30.760
When Joe Biden came in.

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.910
